message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the original slr-pipeline it is built on (see references)."
type: software
title: "slr-pipeline-ui"
abstract: "A desktop app for running a systematic literature review end to end: search, dedup, screening, full-text assessment, extraction, PRISMA 2020 figures, citation verification and a full provenance record. A redesigned UI built on slr-pipeline."
authors:
